う設定があるので、そこだけ気にしてもらえたら、他は全部ぽんさんにおまかせ致します。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1JGMVSnfwrJFN-lg7Igj8gVA1iTxji9Yp", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pon8pon8_/works/21", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/7d4ed240/uploads/origins/376a54d6-8ad7-4601-8b4a-e13491020992?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec7d6351c520521ff65a2c883843db15", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/7d4ed240/uploads/origins/376a54d6-8ad7-4601-8b4a-e13491020992?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec7d6351c520521ff65a2c883843db15, https://si.imgix.net/7d4ed240/uploads/origins/376a54d6-8ad7-4601-8b4a-e13491020992?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc3292c5c5941cdd6ec670d69530e6c8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/7d4ed240/uploads/origins/376a54d6-8ad7-4601-8b4a-e13491020992?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=af8bcb013074ff55b5135ab0ded99301 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "アピールを頂きましてありがとうございます！\n\nそれではﾜﾀｸｼのイラストをお願い致しますわー！！\n\n衣装は資料URLの画像を参考に\nお好きなものを使ってくださいませ。\n\nhttps://onl.bz/KWWCggm", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@pon8pon8_/works/20", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/9ae5e7d2/uploads/origins/dd682a10-05a3-436b-bfe2-bd703032dd55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=178f0981cc75f923d9b6688e13c5ce50", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9ae5e7d2/uploads/origins/dd682a10-05a3-436b-bfe2-bd703032dd55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=178f0981cc75f923d9b6688e13c5ce50, https://si.imgix.net/9ae5e7d2/uploads/origins/dd682a10-05a3-436b-bfe2-bd703032dd55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0019ee2215e406a6d4030696dce945dd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9ae5e7d2/uploads/origins/dd682a10-05a3-436b-bfe2-bd703032dd55?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&cr